{"id":"532789012dd65a85","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-measure10-atom-of-measure.md","title":"ZFC Measure10 Atom Of Measure","display":"df-zfc-measure10-atom-of-measure — ZFC Measure10 Atom Of Measure","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure10-atom-of-measure","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure10-atom-of-measure"],"display":"df-zfc-measure10-atom-of-measure — ZFC Measure10 Atom Of Measure","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure10-atom-of-measure"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure10-atom-of-measure</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure10-atom-of-measure — ZFC Measure10 Atom Of Measure"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-measure.md\">../batch13/58-df-measure.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,A,B\\in V\">\\(X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,A,B\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10AtomOfMeasure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10AtomOfMeasure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}atom\\text{-}of\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10AtomOfMeasure}_S(A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,\\mathcal F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land A\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(A)&gt;0\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(B\\subseteq A\\to(\\mu(B)=0\\lor\\mu(B)=\\mu(A)))\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}atom\\text{-}of\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10AtomOfMeasure}_S(A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,\\mathcal F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land A\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(A)&gt;0\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(B\\subseteq A\\to(\\mu(B)=0\\lor\\mu(B)=\\mu(A)))\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>An atom is required to be measurable and every measurable subset has either zero or full atom measure.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch13/58-df-measure.md","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch13/58-df-measure.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\mathcal F,\\mu,A,B\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Measure}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10AtomOfMeasure}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure10\\text{-}atom\\text{-}of\\text{-}measure}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure10AtomOfMeasure}_S(A,\\mu)\\leftrightarrow\\exists X,\\mathcal F\\;\\left(\\mathrm{Measure}_S(\\mu,X,\\mathcal F)\\land A\\in\\mathcal F\\land\\mu(A)>0\\land\\forall B\\in\\mathcal F\\;(B\\subseteq A\\to(\\mu(B)=0\\lor\\mu(B)=\\mu(A)))\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1000,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2537","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-measure10-atom-of-measure.md|58-df-zfc-measure10-atom-of-measure]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca832ed6bc22f728"]}